Python Control Flow :
Title: List Slicing

Concept:
List slicing : it is creating sublist from the main list using indexing.
(start:end, start:end:step).

Tech used :
Language : pyhton
Compiler : Visual Studio Code

Logic Flow:
`start`: index to begin slicing (inclusive)
`end`: index to stop slicing (exclusive)
`step`: optional interval between elements

Input :
lst = [0, 8, 7, 6, 9, 6, 5, 4, 2, 4, 2, 0]
print(lst[0:7])     
print(lst[3:8])    
print(lst[0:10:3])  

Output :
# → [0, 8, 7, 6, 9, 6, 5]
# → [6, 9, 6, 5, 4]
# → [0, 6, 5, 4]
